      "title": "Introduction",
      "gist": "Flexible top-down control of hundreds of millions of neurons is hard to explain through synaptic change alone, motivating a role for brain waves.",
      "question": "Top-down control — why can't synaptic connections alone explain its speed and flexibility? (a proposed alternative)",
      "sourceHeading": "Introduction"
    },
    "n0018": {
      "id": "n0018",
      "depth": 2,
