      "title": "Mixed Selectivity: Multifunctional neurons enable flexible cognition",
      "gist": "Many cortical neurons are multifunctional rather than specialized, showing nonlinear mixed selectivity in which the same neuron responds differently depending on context, vastly expanding a network's computational and storage capacity.",
