        "spya-jnp59d",
        "spya-trb3jf"
      ],
      "title": "Oscillations organize neural information",
      "gist": "Neural oscillations actively organize, route, and coordinate spiking across circuits, with distinct frequency bands linked to feedforward versus feedback processing, suggesting waves both reflect and instantiate large-scale neural coordination.",
      "sourceHeading": "Oscillations organize neural information"
    },
