      "title": "Altered Cortical Waves and Unconsciousness",
      "gist": "Different anesthetic drugs acting on different molecular targets all converge on the same large-scale effect, slow and desynchronized cortical waves, suggesting consciousness depends on the integrity of large-scale wave organization rather than specific receptors.",
